# =====================================================================
# Release V039 -- Input.Practitioner_Pay (associate % capture)
# =====================================================================
# Adds the Input.Practitioner_Pay table that the app's admin Settings screen writes
# each fee-earner's associate pay % into (foundation for practitioner contribution /
# P&L). Idempotent CREATE (MIGRATE, tracked once-only) so re-deploys never wipe the
# admin-entered values -- the canonical Table.sql is for reference / full rebuilds only.
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V039__practitioner_pay.manifest
# =====================================================================

MIGRATE  Migrations\V039__practitioner_pay.sql

TEST
